<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all four auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all four auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned the all four auctions whereby it sought to drain 2.197 billion pesos from the secondary market on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    700   mln  23 days   21.15 pct</p>
<p>    700   mln  21 days   21.01 pct</p>
<p>    600   mln   9 days   20.16 pct</p>
<p>    197   mln   1 day    20.01 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
